{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>TVB熱播劇集《夫妻的博弈》劇情緊張刺激，除了主線發展備受關注外，主角們的時尚職場穿搭亦成為觀眾熱話。郭柏妍（Rosita）在劇中飾演高海寧（高Ling）的心機閨密潘雪文（Sherman）。為配合角色的「綠茶」形象，劇組在服裝配搭上花盡心思，讓她在每集中轉換多套靚爆造型，更獲網民封為「OL時尚穿搭教科書」。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_212a84439ad72c8b-347\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>為了完美塑造出既專業又清純，郭柏妍在上身服飾方面多以休閒西裝示人，而下身則全數以各款裙裝上陣，大晒纖細身形與優越比例。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_212a84439ad72c8b-347\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"be5b5d8f-6d06-42eb-a24a-f787513fcfae.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026CQMfcNAJgN1786349887.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"be5b5d8f-6d06-42eb-a24a-f787513fcfae.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9a90d2ac-b571-404d-9be4-9d9838ebc222.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20261hzpvhe4Pw1786349887.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9a90d2ac-b571-404d-9be4-9d9838ebc222.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8b75d15d-4a2e-40b4-89b4-8940107aa798.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/202644bbiefiXV1786349887.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8b75d15d-4a2e-40b4-89b4-8940107aa798.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_212a84439ad72c8b-347\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_212a84439ad72c8b-348\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>大批網民與劇迷看後紛紛留言激讚：「Rosita每集Look都好靚，我都想學吓」、「果然係腳柏妍，比例好好，完全少女感」、「迷死人啦，可以出一篇時尚穿搭教學指南」。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T08:39:07.617726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}